{"candidateAnswer":"The one she got more recently","evidence":"[D2:24 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: I bought it a year ago in Paris.\n[D2:28 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: Even as a child I learned to play on my own.\n[D16:6 | 9:26 am on 1 August, 2023] Jolene: I adopted her two years ago when I was feeling lonely and wanted some company.","itemId":"urn:uuid:8db71abc-c359-5824-9116-6746d6d51541","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9443413b3d1ec45ef70d60ee1ec4088a6dbedc5b747427b367be4c7131511763","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which pet did Jolene adopt more recently - Susie or Seraphim?","referenceAnswer":"Seraphim","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9443413b3d1ec45ef70d60ee1ec4088a6dbedc5b747427b367be4c7131511763"}}]}